    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>(Note: Playing this game requires a certain understanding of Chinese idioms. If you are completely unfamiliar with this, the author suggests that you do not try this game easily.)</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Story of Pie Na&quot; is a simple game that combines&quot; filling idioms &quot;and&quot; walking in a maze &quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And on this basis, different game mechanisms are added to enhance players' enjoyment in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715490/extras/1b66319297d3544082bbdf521cd3f1bd.avif?t=1750433142\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take on the role of a human who has fallen to a different realm, constantly advancing or retreating through &quot;filling in idioms&quot; in order to return to their hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the process of understanding and comprehending traditional idioms, players can also play the role of a &quot;traveler&quot;, &quot;ranger&quot;, and &quot;wanderer&quot; who travels through the world, listening to the stories of each character in the game and deciding whether to get involved, making choices that they will not regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715490/extras/6581084ad8a309319d36f3347e4c45ec.avif?t=1750433142\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you hold onto your inner choice until you reach the end of your journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those seemingly settled things are quietly undergoing changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715490/extras/daba66f3f7ec42f04b7504151bdbbadd.avif?t=1750433142\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
